' Question: who reaches into the bots module, and through what?
' Explained by: ../03-context.md, which cites each edge. Drawn by hand, high level.
' An arrow's label is what crosses the edge; every one is in bots/contracts/ except the shell's.
@startuml 03-context-in
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
[shell] as SH
[operations\n(headless run, status)] as OP
[alerting] as AL
[command line\n(bot verbs)] as CLI
[bots] as B
SH --> B : module.py only
OP --> B : IBotPlan, host commands,\nGetBotStatusReportQuery
AL --> B : BotChangedEvent, BotStopGaveUpEvent,\nGetBotStatusReportQuery
CLI --> B : list, show, apply, export
@enduml
